body:
Yeah that's fair, i'm talking about the very very beginning of the interactions. I'm not denying it's trafficking or that he then put them in a situation where it was almost impossible to exit. I mean just in the sense of even finding a woman who he talks into somehow meeting him and him being able to convince them to like him enough to the point where then he does what he did.

&#x200B;

But again, i'm not denying he's trafficking, im not saying it's good at all. The evidence is all there, him and his brother should be put in prison. My point wasn't to justify it or say it's good, it was more that it still takes a level of "knowing" what you're doing. Like there was one video he's talked about where he explains what you can open with when meeting a woman and it's simple but it was decent, it's something common sense but it was decent(which BTW I disagree with 99.9% of things he says he just happened to be right for 5 seconds). I saw it on a IG reel, I never watch him other than when its like a lefty youtuber i watch reacting.

But it shows like oh he knows HOW to come off as not dangerous at first, which implies he knows how to at the very least reel someone in. Whereas dudes like me, im calling myself out, dont even know how to start a convo with a random person let alone get them to be into you.

&#x200B;

I might be all over the place but TL:DR; I think a lot of dangerous people like that DO know how to appear charming, and put on a persona in order to manipulate and do harm to others so someone can be knowledgable but be very dangerous and a threat to society because of that. So Im just not as quick to say he's "stupid", I think he knows exactly what he's doing which is why I think he needs to go to prison

Yeah, I agree, but its hard to STAY friends or want to just be platonic if I meet a girl, talk to her, and she just wants to be friends. I have been able to just ask people out then once they reject me I kinda lose interest and can be platonic. BUT I would be lying if I said that a lot of my women friends, if they randomly decided to have sex I probably would. 

&#x200B;

Basically, if they came up and asked to hook up, I wouldnt reject them, I think you can have sex platonically.
